    "name": "Keen Cached Queries API",
    "description": "The Keen Cached Queries API allows developers to create, manage, and retrieve pre-defined queries that are automatically refreshed on a schedule. Cached queries improve performance for frequently accessed analytics by storing pre-computed results, making them ideal for powering dashboards and embedded analytics experiences without incurring per-request rate limits.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Keen Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
